abstract: "PALO (Principled AI Lifecycle Orchestration) is an open-source framework and toolkit for operational AI governance, translating principles, laws, standards and organizational requirements into lifecycle decisions, risk assessments, evidence artifacts, governance controls, KPIs/KRIs and repeatable governance gates, including governance patterns for agentic AI systems."
keywords:
  - "AI governance"
  - "Responsible AI"
  - "agentic AI"
  - "AI agents"
  - "AI risk management"
  - "human oversight"
  - "EU AI Act"
  - "NIST AI RMF"
  - "ISO/IEC 42001"
  - "governance as code"
